          "predecessor": "def _policy(flags,operation,dtype):\n    # Existing metric policy pattern: one scalar metadata probe delivers the\n    # source NumPy exception/warning/callback wording. No image computation.\n    if not flags:return\n    if flags&1:\n        if operation=='sqrt':np.sqrt(np.array([-1.],dtype=dtype))\n        else:np.multiply(np.array([np.inf],dtype=dtype),np.array([0.],dtype=dtype))\n    if flags&2:np.divide(np.array([1.],dtype=dtype),np.array([0.],dtype=dtype))\n    if flags&4:np.multiply(np.array([np.finfo(dtype).max],dtype=dtype),np.array([2.],dtype=dtype))\n    if flags&8:np.multiply(np.array([np.finfo(dtype).tiny],dtype=dtype),np.array([np.finfo(dtype).tiny],dtype=dtype))\n"
